WEBVTT

01:56.160 --> 01:57.440
Alright then.

01:57.960 --> 01:58.960
We forget

01:59.479 --> 02:00.160
it and move on.

02:03.720 --> 02:04.640
This is

02:04.680 --> 02:05.160
your KPI for today.

02:05.880 --> 02:07.640
I'll add you back to the group chat.

02:08.280 --> 02:09.720
From now on, we can just

02:10.039 --> 02:11.080
use the group

02:11.440 --> 02:12.280
for anything.

02:13.960 --> 02:15.240
Work hard, Xing Wu.

02:15.760 --> 02:16.280
You've got this.

02:34.800 --> 02:35.240
Auntie.

02:36.200 --> 02:37.000
Good morning.

02:37.240 --> 02:38.840
Good morning, Ye.

02:39.079 --> 02:41.000
You're gonna be swamped

02:41.200 --> 02:42.880
all day long today.

02:44.120 --> 02:44.920
Don't laugh.

02:45.440 --> 02:47.480
Your hands will ache from styling hair.

02:47.600 --> 02:48.600
It's fine. I love my job.

02:49.040 --> 02:49.440
Okay.

02:49.560 --> 02:50.520
Alright you two,

02:50.800 --> 02:51.920
ready?

02:52.040 --> 02:53.360
Ready.

02:53.440 --> 02:55.800
Let's open up for business.

02:56.320 --> 02:57.840
Hope business booms!

02:58.040 --> 02:58.280
Let's go.

02:58.360 --> 02:58.640
Let's go.

03:12.280 --> 03:13.080
Wait, this...

03:13.520 --> 03:14.520
This can't be right.

03:14.720 --> 03:16.280
The promo was great.

03:16.920 --> 03:18.280
We can't have no customers at all.

03:18.640 --> 03:20.360
Maybe it's too early?

03:20.600 --> 03:21.800
Who'd get their hair done

03:21.800 --> 03:23.120
so early in the morning?

03:24.440 --> 03:24.960
Fair point.

03:26.920 --> 03:27.840
Folks in Zhazhating

03:27.840 --> 03:29.079
never change their hairstyles.

03:29.920 --> 03:30.840
Flyers alone

03:30.840 --> 03:31.720
won't change that.

03:32.280 --> 03:33.360
What do you mean never change?

03:33.840 --> 03:35.360
Didn't you go from blonde to black?

03:36.120 --> 03:36.920
Well, that's...

03:38.960 --> 03:39.320
Right.

03:39.920 --> 03:41.400
Can you lend the camera again?

03:41.960 --> 03:43.120
Should be fine.

03:45.960 --> 03:46.400
Follow me.

03:49.240 --> 03:49.840
Where are you going?

03:49.920 --> 03:51.200
What are you up to, Ye?

03:53.480 --> 03:54.840
Lanfang, what do we do now?

03:55.800 --> 03:56.800
Beats me.

03:57.079 --> 03:57.720
Just wait.

03:58.160 --> 03:59.520
Xuan Island!

03:59.720 --> 04:01.560
Free portrait with any hairstyle!

04:01.920 --> 04:03.440
Get the trendy wool perm!

04:03.640 --> 04:05.000
Come take a look!

04:06.120 --> 04:07.040
Fresh new hairstyles!

04:07.280 --> 04:08.560
Xuan Island!

04:08.600 --> 04:10.480
Free portrait with any hairstyle!

04:10.480 --> 04:11.200
Get the trendy wool perm!

04:11.200 --> 04:12.120
Take a look!

04:12.160 --> 04:14.560
Capture your precious moments!

04:14.760 --> 04:15.920
Get the trendy wool perm!

04:16.279 --> 04:17.519
Xuan Island!

04:17.720 --> 04:19.560
Free portrait with any hairstyle!

04:19.720 --> 04:20.920
Look like a star instantly!

04:21.120 --> 04:23.280
Capture your precious moments!

04:23.320 --> 04:25.080
Don't miss out!

04:25.280 --> 04:26.600
Xuan Island!

04:26.720 --> 04:28.640
Free portrait with any hairstyle!

04:28.720 --> 04:29.920
Look like a star instantly!

04:30.080 --> 04:32.720
Capture your precious moments!

04:42.520 --> 04:43.880
It's already this late.

04:43.880 --> 04:44.440
Why still closed?

04:44.560 --> 04:45.400
Yeah.

04:45.600 --> 04:46.520
It said free photos.

04:47.400 --> 04:47.840
Lanfang.

04:48.280 --> 04:48.800
Lanfang.

04:50.440 --> 04:51.520
That's you in the ad, right?

04:51.760 --> 04:52.400
Yeah.

04:52.920 --> 04:54.040
It really is you!

04:54.040 --> 04:54.880
Sure is!

04:55.480 --> 04:56.040
We all want

04:56.040 --> 04:57.120
the same hairstyle.

04:57.120 --> 04:58.240
No problem at all!

04:58.640 --> 04:59.960
Lanfang, Lanfang, Lanfang.

05:00.120 --> 05:00.400
Over here!

05:00.520 --> 05:01.360
I want this perm.

05:02.120 --> 05:02.760
You promised

05:02.760 --> 05:03.800
free portraits with hair service.

05:04.280 --> 05:05.040
We'll make you look

05:05.040 --> 05:05.960
like a big star.

05:06.640 --> 05:07.720
I'm the first customer.

05:07.840 --> 05:08.640
Do my perm first!

05:08.720 --> 05:10.360
No way, I got here first!

05:10.360 --> 05:11.400
I was first!

05:11.480 --> 05:12.280
I was first!

05:12.280 --> 05:12.800
No way!

05:12.800 --> 05:13.720
I arrived earlier!

05:14.480 --> 05:15.040
Ms. Qian.

05:15.400 --> 05:16.640
Maybe you can wait a bit?

05:17.360 --> 05:18.560
You're totally swamped.

05:18.760 --> 05:19.640
I'll come back another day.

05:19.840 --> 05:20.760
I know you're busy.

05:20.800 --> 05:21.120
Alright then.

05:21.160 --> 05:21.720
I'm off to work.

05:21.720 --> 05:22.440
Please do come back!

05:22.520 --> 05:23.480
Sure, I will.

05:23.560 --> 05:23.800
Okay.

05:23.880 --> 05:24.840
Don't be upset.

05:24.840 --> 05:25.600
Alright, alright, alright.

05:25.600 --> 05:26.800
Ms. Qian, you came too.

05:27.320 --> 05:28.760
Oh, I didn't get to be first.

05:28.840 --> 05:30.160
Everyone, take it easy now.

05:30.280 --> 05:31.200
No rush at all.

05:31.480 --> 05:32.920
This hairstyle is gorgeous.

05:33.159 --> 05:34.000
Excuse me, coming through!

05:34.000 --> 05:35.080
We ladies are getting our hair done.

05:35.080 --> 05:35.680
What about you?

05:35.720 --> 05:36.880
That's exactly why I'm here.

05:36.880 --> 05:37.320
I'm...

05:37.360 --> 05:38.600
We're also here for perms.

05:38.640 --> 05:39.920
I mean, I'm the stylist here.

05:40.640 --> 05:41.640
Liu Nian, Liu Nian.

05:42.120 --> 05:42.520
Over here.

05:43.120 --> 05:45.040
Everyone, let me introduce you.

05:45.159 --> 05:46.120
This is our

05:46.200 --> 05:47.440
lead stylist.

05:48.200 --> 05:48.720
Leave your hair

05:48.720 --> 05:49.560
all to me.

05:49.640 --> 05:49.960
Let me see.

05:50.240 --> 05:51.159
I want this perm.

05:51.200 --> 05:51.920
This one.

05:52.040 --> 05:53.280
Just like hers.

05:53.280 --> 05:53.720
No worries.

05:53.920 --> 05:54.640
Sure thing.

05:54.800 --> 05:56.080
Let's start with a shampoo.

05:56.200 --> 05:56.520
Okay.

05:56.640 --> 05:57.159
This way please.

05:57.280 --> 05:57.920
Next customer.

05:58.000 --> 05:58.720
You're up next.

05:58.840 --> 05:59.159
Okay.

05:59.960 --> 06:01.920
We heard perm comes with a free portrait.

06:02.280 --> 06:03.040
I want this style.

06:03.840 --> 06:04.400
Alright.

06:04.760 --> 06:05.440
I like this one.

06:05.480 --> 06:06.440
I like this one.

06:06.440 --> 06:07.400
Let me look at your hair.

06:07.400 --> 06:08.640
Alright, okay, no problem.

06:11.040 --> 06:11.480
Nice.

06:11.560 --> 06:12.560
Give me a smile.

06:14.040 --> 06:14.640
Gorgeous.

06:14.880 --> 06:15.360
Quanya.

06:15.840 --> 06:16.280
Coming!

06:17.440 --> 06:18.920
Stand right here, please.

06:20.200 --> 06:20.520
Okay.

06:23.040 --> 06:23.640
Perfect.

06:23.640 --> 06:24.560
So beautiful.

06:25.240 --> 06:25.880
Ye.

06:26.280 --> 06:27.000
Come take a look.

06:27.520 --> 06:28.720
Doesn't she look like Maggie Cheung?

06:29.400 --> 06:30.760
Well,

06:31.320 --> 06:33.080
more like Brigitte Lin.

06:33.640 --> 06:34.480
Have some water, ma'am.

06:35.040 --> 06:36.040
Whoever she resembles,

06:36.280 --> 06:37.960
this perm makes her

06:38.000 --> 06:38.840
look even younger.

06:39.600 --> 06:40.200
Alright.

06:40.280 --> 06:41.159
You two sure know

06:41.240 --> 06:42.159
how to sweet-talk.

06:43.159 --> 06:43.600
Ma'am,

06:44.200 --> 06:45.080
glad you like it.

06:45.200 --> 06:46.880
Please help spread the word.

06:47.159 --> 06:48.640
Here's a free hair mousse for you.

06:49.080 --> 06:50.240
Love it, absolutely.

06:50.480 --> 06:51.960
This style really flatters me.

06:52.520 --> 06:53.560
This way

06:53.600 --> 06:54.200
for your photoshoot.

06:54.280 --> 06:55.040
Just charge it

06:55.080 --> 06:56.120
to my account.

06:56.400 --> 06:57.360
Will do.

06:58.040 --> 06:58.520
Quanya.

06:59.200 --> 06:59.760
Another client.

07:00.040 --> 07:01.520
Take great shots for her.

07:01.560 --> 07:02.080
Take plenty.

07:02.200 --> 07:02.720
No problem.

07:02.800 --> 07:03.560
Stand right here, ma'am.

07:03.600 --> 07:04.120
Okay.

07:07.480 --> 07:09.080
We're fully booked this afternoon.

07:09.120 --> 07:10.400
So many reservations.

07:11.880 --> 07:12.640
We can't keep up.

07:12.720 --> 07:14.480
Way too many customers.

07:14.800 --> 07:16.760
We're swamped, Ye.

07:17.360 --> 07:18.120
Right, Auntie,

07:18.560 --> 07:19.280
remember

07:19.760 --> 07:21.440
to pay Quanya for his work.

07:21.720 --> 07:22.920
We can't let him work for free.

07:23.800 --> 07:24.640
I know.

07:24.920 --> 07:25.600
I'm not

07:25.600 --> 07:27.040
unreasonable.

07:27.200 --> 07:28.560
But all morning long, I've just been

07:28.600 --> 07:30.480
rolling and removing perm rods.

07:30.560 --> 07:31.760
And my hands

07:31.760 --> 07:33.400
are stiff now.

07:34.480 --> 07:35.600
I haven't even made lunch.

07:36.680 --> 07:38.200
I ordered food from Big G's.

07:38.200 --> 07:38.840
It'll be here soon.

07:40.040 --> 07:40.720
Ye.

07:40.720 --> 07:42.240
What would I do without you?

07:42.280 --> 07:43.600
You've thought of everything.

07:44.760 --> 07:45.360
You know,

07:45.920 --> 07:47.720
when business was slow,

07:48.040 --> 07:48.960
I wished for more customers.

07:49.320 --> 07:50.520
Now that it's booming,

07:50.600 --> 07:51.640
I feel overwhelmed.

07:52.560 --> 07:53.920
Am I being weird?

07:55.720 --> 07:58.000
Put that aside for now.

07:58.400 --> 07:59.560
Hard work always pays off.

08:00.400 --> 08:01.800
I just calculated

08:01.800 --> 08:02.480
this week's profit.

08:03.080 --> 08:03.640
Really?

08:05.040 --> 08:05.600
Liu Nian,

08:06.280 --> 08:07.720
wanna see the numbers?

08:07.720 --> 08:08.480
Absolutely.

08:12.640 --> 08:13.200
Five thou...

08:14.720 --> 08:16.600
Is this really just one week's earnings?

08:18.840 --> 08:20.040
It was worth it that you only

08:20.120 --> 08:21.840
played mahjong

08:22.320 --> 08:22.920
twice this week.

08:24.200 --> 08:26.040
I feel like I've struck it rich.

08:26.120 --> 08:27.120
I never made this much

08:27.160 --> 08:27.840
in a whole month

08:27.840 --> 08:28.880
before.

08:29.200 --> 08:30.360
It's all thanks to Qing Ye.

08:30.760 --> 08:31.840
Great promotion

08:32.039 --> 08:33.320
brings solid profits.

08:34.360 --> 08:35.520
You're basically our best ad

08:35.520 --> 08:36.159
for the shop.

08:36.520 --> 08:37.799
Nine out of ten customers

08:38.200 --> 08:39.000
who come for perms

08:39.200 --> 08:40.280
want the exact same look.

08:40.600 --> 08:41.080
Totally right.

08:41.440 --> 08:42.440
No matter their age,

08:42.520 --> 08:44.039
everyone asks for Qing Ye's hairstyle.

08:45.400 --> 08:45.720
Ye,

08:46.040 --> 08:47.440
strike a pose.

09:26.280 --> 09:27.880
Sir, please hurry.

09:28.360 --> 09:28.960
Got it.

09:46.560 --> 09:47.240
Qing Ye.

10:01.880 --> 10:02.800
Follow me.

10:04.200 --> 10:05.480
Handle everything with care.

10:06.000 --> 10:07.520
Put these over there.

10:07.560 --> 10:09.400
Sort the rest by category.

10:10.440 --> 10:11.640
Hurry up.

10:17.360 --> 10:18.720
How's it going? Smooth?

10:19.160 --> 10:20.000
If you need anything,

10:20.040 --> 10:20.760
just let me know.

10:21.640 --> 10:22.720
I left your campus pass

10:22.760 --> 10:23.440
right here.

10:24.320 --> 10:24.640
Thanks.

10:28.000 --> 10:28.720
Pretty nice, huh?

10:29.320 --> 10:30.040
Listen, Mr. Ye

10:30.320 --> 10:32.400
is really pleased with you.

10:32.960 --> 10:34.720
To save you the commute,

10:35.160 --> 10:35.880
I applied for a staff dorm

10:35.880 --> 10:37.200
for you here.

10:37.840 --> 10:38.880
You may stay temporarily.

10:39.160 --> 10:39.880
It's free of charge.

10:40.360 --> 10:40.960
No thanks.

10:41.640 --> 10:42.480
Please thank Mr. Ye for me.

10:42.760 --> 10:43.320
Why not?

10:43.760 --> 10:45.840
The daily commute is time-consuming.

10:46.040 --> 10:47.000
Isn't it tiring?

10:48.360 --> 10:49.160
I need to look after my family.

10:50.480 --> 10:51.080
Fair enough.

10:51.520 --> 10:52.720
Your grandma needs care.

10:52.720 --> 10:53.760
You can't stay far away.

10:54.680 --> 10:55.160
It's alright.

10:55.520 --> 10:56.720
I'll tell Mr. Ye.

10:56.880 --> 10:57.880
He'll totally understand.

10:59.760 --> 11:00.200
Wait.

11:01.160 --> 11:01.800
Here.

11:08.040 --> 11:09.960
Even your sister couldn't get you

11:09.960 --> 11:10.880
to go out and have fun.

11:11.560 --> 11:12.880
If you really want to treat your staff,

11:13.240 --> 11:15.400
how about turning the tickets into cash?

11:15.720 --> 11:16.360
I'd really appreciate it.

11:17.880 --> 11:18.320
Sure.

11:19.320 --> 11:20.720
But keep the tickets anyway.

11:21.640 --> 11:22.960
Maybe your sister wants to go.

11:23.880 --> 11:24.480
I'll leave you to it.

11:25.640 --> 11:26.120
Hey,

11:26.720 --> 11:27.600
are you heading out later?

11:28.520 --> 11:29.000
What's up?

11:29.400 --> 11:30.000
Give me a ride.

11:30.840 --> 11:31.720
Stunning!

11:31.760 --> 11:33.400
This hairstyle suits you perfectly.

11:33.960 --> 11:34.960
Please come again.

11:35.000 --> 11:35.800
Okay, okay, okay.

11:36.480 --> 11:37.840
Please help spread the word.

11:37.920 --> 11:38.720
No problem.

11:40.520 --> 11:41.480
To keep the salon

11:41.520 --> 11:42.680
running well long-term,

11:42.680 --> 11:43.880
besides

11:44.360 --> 11:45.720
promotion and skills,

11:45.880 --> 11:46.720
service matters too.

11:46.840 --> 11:49.200
We need to be extra

11:49.520 --> 11:50.880
thoughtful and attentive.

11:50.960 --> 11:51.880
We should greet every guest

11:52.160 --> 11:52.840
with great warmth.

11:53.320 --> 11:54.880
Like "Welcome to Xuan Island".

11:55.120 --> 11:55.840
Make them feel

11:56.000 --> 11:57.280
right at home.

11:57.400 --> 11:58.400
I get it.

11:58.480 --> 11:59.400
First, smile wide,

11:59.520 --> 12:00.520
show your teeth.

12:00.800 --> 12:02.480
And speak in a lively tone

12:02.520 --> 12:03.960
to draw attention.

12:04.440 --> 12:05.640
Welcome!

12:06.240 --> 12:07.280
To Xuan Island.

12:08.720 --> 12:09.640
That's the idea.

12:09.680 --> 12:10.280
That's the idea.

12:10.280 --> 12:10.840
Same as what I was thinking.

12:11.760 --> 12:12.480
Right, Ye.

12:12.640 --> 12:14.880
I noticed other salons

12:15.160 --> 12:16.720
offer way more services.

12:16.880 --> 12:18.320
Besides hair styling,

12:18.360 --> 12:20.160
they do eyebrow tattooing,

12:20.360 --> 12:21.120
hair spa...

12:21.520 --> 12:22.840
Should I learn

12:22.880 --> 12:23.960
eyebrow tattooing?

12:24.320 --> 12:25.040
We could

12:25.040 --> 12:26.200
earn more that way.

12:27.600 --> 12:28.240
Auntie,

12:28.280 --> 12:29.160
I think we should

12:29.160 --> 12:31.040
focus on hairdressing first.

12:31.480 --> 12:32.640
Those extra skills take time

12:32.640 --> 12:33.440
to master.

12:34.080 --> 12:35.880
We shouldn't rush into new things

12:36.000 --> 12:36.880
before we get steady on our feet.

12:37.320 --> 12:38.240
You're right.

12:38.440 --> 12:39.320
First of all,

12:39.640 --> 12:40.560
treat

12:40.560 --> 12:42.640
every passer-by

12:43.080 --> 12:43.800
as our guest.

12:44.120 --> 12:44.560
Got it.

12:45.520 --> 12:45.920
Alright.

12:46.840 --> 12:49.680
Welcome to Xuan Island.

12:50.800 --> 12:53.600
Welcome to Xuan Island.

12:54.760 --> 12:57.840
Welcome to Xuan Island.

13:01.680 --> 13:02.240
Qing Ye.

13:05.520 --> 13:06.360
Meng Ruihang.

13:06.720 --> 13:07.560
What brings you here?

13:10.600 --> 13:11.640
Thanks, Bo.

13:11.720 --> 13:12.120
Qing Ye,

13:12.880 --> 13:13.320
is that your friend

13:13.320 --> 13:14.400
from Beijing?

13:15.280 --> 13:16.040
Pretty handsome.

13:27.360 --> 13:28.720
Try this drink,

13:28.960 --> 13:29.440
the local specialty.

13:31.360 --> 13:32.040
It's tasty.

13:35.640 --> 13:36.240
Really nice.

13:37.680 --> 13:38.720
Your new hairstyle looks nice.

13:40.240 --> 13:41.600
Just a casual perm

13:41.720 --> 13:42.480
for practice.

13:45.800 --> 13:47.040
Have a seat.

13:48.280 --> 13:48.960
It's not dirty.

13:49.000 --> 13:50.280
Just some wear and tear

13:50.280 --> 13:51.080
from wind and sun.

13:56.400 --> 13:57.280
To be honest,

13:57.440 --> 13:58.560
before I came here,

13:59.000 --> 14:00.440
I thought the living conditions

14:00.440 --> 14:01.200
wouldn't be great.

14:01.560 --> 14:02.280
How do you find it now?

14:04.000 --> 14:05.080
It's even worse than I imagined.

14:06.240 --> 14:07.720
This is just how Zhazhating is.

14:08.120 --> 14:09.200
I couldn't get used to it

14:09.200 --> 14:10.040
at first either.

14:10.960 --> 14:12.600
The air smells of fish,

14:13.120 --> 14:14.640
and there are all sorts of big bugs.

14:15.040 --> 14:16.720
I wanted to leave right on my first day.

14:17.160 --> 14:17.680
Qing Ye,

14:18.880 --> 14:19.960
how have you been

14:19.960 --> 14:21.000
holding up here all this time?

14:22.280 --> 14:23.400
Just get used to it.

14:23.760 --> 14:24.720
Time will help.

14:30.440 --> 14:31.920
Still upset about what happened in Beijing?

14:35.840 --> 14:37.480
Ever since my family ran into trouble,

14:38.640 --> 14:39.960
out of all our old friends,

14:40.840 --> 14:42.160
only you have stayed by my side.

14:43.360 --> 14:44.720
I'm nothing but grateful to you.

14:47.640 --> 14:48.600
That's a huge relief.

14:49.040 --> 14:50.840
I was worried you'd refuse to see me.

14:51.240 --> 14:52.800
So I brought a peace offering.

14:55.120 --> 14:56.920
That young man looks gentle and refined.

14:57.960 --> 14:59.520
Clearly a city fellow.

15:01.040 --> 15:01.680
Wonder

15:01.720 --> 15:02.960
what he wants with Ye.

15:03.960 --> 15:04.400
Lanfang.

15:04.880 --> 15:06.760
What do you think their relationship is?

15:07.160 --> 15:08.120
This is from that dessert shop

15:08.120 --> 15:09.600
we used to go to.

15:10.440 --> 15:11.720
Your favorite flavor,

15:11.920 --> 15:13.000
cheese and sea salt.

15:14.600 --> 15:15.840
This cake traveled

15:15.840 --> 15:17.800
hundreds of kilometers to get here.

15:18.080 --> 15:18.840
Must have been tough.

15:18.840 --> 15:20.000
Thank you, delivery guy.

15:20.400 --> 15:21.440
It's nothing.

15:21.600 --> 15:22.600
It's us, come on.

15:24.520 --> 15:25.640
Put it away before it melts.

15:26.000 --> 15:26.520
We can share it

15:26.680 --> 15:28.120
with Auntie and the others.

15:28.400 --> 15:28.760
Sure.

15:33.120 --> 15:34.360
Does your mom know

15:34.760 --> 15:35.640
you're here to see me?

15:41.280 --> 15:42.800
Maybe we can chat somewhere else.

15:43.960 --> 15:44.360
Alright.

15:44.840 --> 15:45.560
It's pretty sunny out here.

15:46.400 --> 15:47.480
Have you booked a hotel room?

15:48.120 --> 15:48.640
Not yet.

15:49.520 --> 15:50.160
Then where will you stay?

15:50.520 --> 15:51.160
Up to you.

15:51.480 --> 15:52.160
Anywhere is fine.

15:52.680 --> 15:54.400
That's so unlike you.

15:54.400 --> 15:55.560
You always plan everything out.

15:56.520 --> 15:57.680
But you're here, right?

15:57.680 --> 15:58.400
I know you'll

15:58.400 --> 15:59.400
sort everything out for me.

16:00.800 --> 16:01.240
Fine.

16:01.520 --> 16:02.640
Come with me to the salon first.

16:02.720 --> 16:03.080
Okay.

16:03.240 --> 16:03.560
Let's go.

16:05.600 --> 16:06.080
Lead the way.

16:12.640 --> 16:13.240
Auntie,

16:13.720 --> 16:14.640
I'm heading out for a bit.

16:15.040 --> 16:16.160
I'll take him to find a hotel.

16:20.400 --> 16:21.800
Let Liu Nian go with you.

16:22.280 --> 16:23.040
No need, Auntie.

16:23.720 --> 16:24.320
Don't trouble yourselves.

16:24.520 --> 16:25.320
Yeah, it's really fine.

16:25.840 --> 16:26.600
No trouble at all.

16:27.440 --> 16:28.320
It's nothing.

16:31.360 --> 16:32.160
By the way, Auntie,

16:32.320 --> 16:33.720
he brought this cake

16:33.720 --> 16:34.680
all the way from Beijing.

16:34.720 --> 16:35.640
I used to love it.

16:35.640 --> 16:36.400
You guys haven't tried it before.

16:36.600 --> 16:37.240
Have a taste.

16:37.480 --> 16:37.800
Yeah.

16:37.840 --> 16:39.280
It's a famous cake in Beijing.

16:39.320 --> 16:39.880
Help yourself.

16:41.720 --> 16:42.560
A cake?

16:45.280 --> 16:46.960
We're off then.

16:48.480 --> 16:49.640
Come back soon, okay?

16:50.600 --> 16:51.200
Bye, Auntie.

16:51.520 --> 16:52.040
Let's go.

16:52.720 --> 16:53.360
Grab your things.

16:58.720 --> 17:01.200
Why does this cake come in a shell?

17:07.480 --> 17:07.960
Lanfang.

17:08.560 --> 17:10.119
This cake costs 588 yuan.

17:11.599 --> 17:12.400
Mom.

17:12.599 --> 17:13.560
Come out and have some cake.

17:13.839 --> 17:14.720
Can I have a piece too?

17:21.720 --> 17:22.319
Cousin!

17:22.839 --> 17:23.319
Qing Ye!

17:23.359 --> 17:23.920
Where are you off to?

17:26.400 --> 17:27.280
New friends

17:27.280 --> 17:28.280
I made here.

17:29.600 --> 17:30.120
Who's this?

17:30.440 --> 17:31.800
Hi, I'm Meng Ruihang.

17:31.840 --> 17:33.120
I grew up with Qing Ye.

17:33.120 --> 17:34.160
We're childhood friends.

17:35.800 --> 17:36.400
Childhood friends, huh?

17:37.280 --> 17:37.720
Yeah.

17:40.840 --> 17:41.800
What a coincidence.

17:42.520 --> 17:43.320
We've got the same shoes.

17:43.920 --> 17:44.960
Looks like we share the same taste.

17:45.960 --> 17:47.680
Yeah, exactly the same. Look.

17:47.760 --> 17:48.240
See?

17:49.880 --> 17:50.240
True.

17:50.720 --> 17:51.520
Wait man,

17:51.560 --> 17:53.960
yours aren't as nice.

17:54.280 --> 17:55.720
Ours shine brighter.

17:55.760 --> 17:56.120
See?

17:56.200 --> 17:57.200
Yeah.

17:57.800 --> 17:58.920
Are those knockoffs?

18:00.160 --> 18:00.960
Seems like it.

18:01.040 --> 18:01.920
Where did you two get yours?

18:02.720 --> 18:04.280
Direct from the factory, authentic patterns.

18:05.800 --> 18:07.440
Impressive.

18:08.280 --> 18:09.600
Since we've got similar taste,

18:09.600 --> 18:10.320
let's be friends.

18:10.480 --> 18:11.640
Add each other on WeChat.

18:11.840 --> 18:12.200
Come on.

18:12.560 --> 18:13.320
Alright, that's enough.

18:13.320 --> 18:14.440
Get back to work you guys.

18:14.760 --> 18:15.760
We're heading to the hotel.

18:16.520 --> 18:16.960
What?

18:18.960 --> 18:19.480
Where are you going?

18:21.640 --> 18:22.320
What are you staring at?

18:22.840 --> 18:24.120
I'm taking him to find a place to stay.

18:27.360 --> 18:28.200
Let's go.

18:28.920 --> 18:29.920
Wait, we didn't exchange WeChat yet!

18:30.400 --> 18:31.680
I'll add you to the group later.

18:31.760 --> 18:32.480
We're off now.

18:33.200 --> 18:33.720
Bye.

18:36.640 --> 18:38.120
Add me to the group?

18:40.840 --> 18:41.400
Wu.

18:41.880 --> 18:42.560
Qing Ye's childhood friend

18:42.560 --> 18:43.560
came all the way from Beijing.

18:44.720 --> 18:45.640
Looks like trouble.

19:12.920 --> 19:14.120
You don't mean

19:14.120 --> 19:14.880
I'm staying here, what about you?

19:15.160 --> 19:16.320
Even the worst hotel back home

19:16.320 --> 19:16.920
is better than this.

19:17.960 --> 19:19.560
This is just the standard here.

19:19.800 --> 19:20.960
If you want a vacation

19:21.360 --> 19:22.040
and a nice hotel,

19:22.160 --> 19:22.960
you'll have to go to the county seat.

19:23.400 --> 19:24.000
I'll book you the one

19:24.000 --> 19:24.800
I stayed at last time.

19:25.320 --> 19:26.640
A deluxe sea-view suite.

19:26.920 --> 19:27.920
It's the best around here.

19:28.480 --> 19:28.920
Okay?

19:30.080 --> 19:30.480
Alright.

19:30.560 --> 19:30.920
Let's go.

19:40.520 --> 19:41.560
Hi, we'd like a room.

19:42.080 --> 19:43.240
Only one room left.

19:43.240 --> 19:44.440
The deluxe sea-view suite. 588 yuan.

19:48.720 --> 19:49.840
Are you serious?

19:50.000 --> 19:51.480
588 yuan for this place?

19:51.720 --> 19:52.640
Last room available.

19:52.960 --> 19:53.720
Take it or leave it.

19:54.200 --> 19:55.160
We'll take it.

19:55.400 --> 19:56.600
Air conditioning and Wi-Fi work fine, huh?

19:59.320 --> 20:00.120
Wu's cousin?

20:01.080 --> 20:02.400
Can we get a discount?

20:02.560 --> 20:03.360
Of course.

20:03.880 --> 20:05.000
Platinum member price:

20:05.160 --> 20:05.960
288 yuan.

20:06.120 --> 20:07.080
Thanks a lot.

20:07.400 --> 20:09.520
Just so you know, the guy next door

20:09.520 --> 20:10.120
is still here.

20:10.280 --> 20:10.960
He's a live streamer

20:10.960 --> 20:11.920
and rents the room long-term.

20:12.240 --> 20:13.280
Don't cause

20:13.600 --> 20:14.720
any trouble this time, okay?

20:15.480 --> 20:16.040
Don't worry.

20:16.320 --> 20:17.520
This friend of mine is very polite.

20:17.840 --> 20:19.240
He definitely won't start any conflict.

20:19.840 --> 20:20.360
ID, please.

20:25.720 --> 20:26.160
Let's go.

20:36.320 --> 20:36.880
Here, take this.

20:38.200 --> 20:38.800
What's this?

20:39.520 --> 20:40.040
Earplugs.

20:40.360 --> 20:41.120
You'll need them.

20:45.560 --> 20:48.560
Fourteen, fifteen, sixteen.

20:48.600 --> 20:49.920
Seventeen, eighteen.

20:51.160 --> 20:52.800
Exceeded the target.

20:53.280 --> 20:54.400
So fast.

20:54.600 --> 20:55.360
Nicely done.

20:56.240 --> 20:57.440
Finish early, knock off early.

20:57.760 --> 20:59.120
Otherwise I'd miss your ride.

20:59.520 --> 21:00.280
No problem.

21:00.840 --> 21:02.400
I'll cover whatever you want to buy.

21:03.320 --> 21:03.800
No need.

21:04.200 --> 21:04.960
One thing's one thing.

21:05.960 --> 21:07.200
Wu, big trouble.

21:07.720 --> 21:08.840
Your cousin brought that handsome guy

21:08.840 --> 21:09.520
from Beijing to check into a hotel.

21:21.200 --> 21:21.680
Wu.

21:22.120 --> 21:22.840
Qing Ye's childhood friend

21:22.840 --> 21:23.920
came all the way from Beijing.

21:24.240 --> 21:25.040
Big trouble.

21:25.560 --> 21:26.520
I'll skip the shopping for now.

21:31.200 --> 21:32.440
Can I borrow your car?

21:36.880 --> 21:38.240
I've never seen you this flustered.

21:38.720 --> 21:39.240
Thanks.

21:45.560 --> 21:46.000
Remember,

21:46.640 --> 21:47.840
you need the room card for electricity.

21:49.000 --> 21:50.560
What's that smell, Qing Ye?

21:51.560 --> 21:52.680
The smell of the ocean.

21:53.440 --> 21:54.480
Just air it out.

21:56.720 --> 21:57.480
But make sure

21:57.640 --> 21:59.280
to close the window tight at night.

21:59.400 --> 22:00.120
Otherwise the mosquitoes

22:00.160 --> 22:01.280
will bite you nonstop.

22:01.320 --> 22:02.040
Sounds like you

22:02.040 --> 22:02.840
know this place well.

22:03.600 --> 22:04.680
I told you before,

22:04.880 --> 22:06.240
I once stayed in a hotel to get away.

22:06.840 --> 22:07.640
It was exactly this room.

22:07.800 --> 22:09.000
The bugs kept me up all night.

22:10.520 --> 22:11.440
You're luckier than I was.

22:12.000 --> 22:12.840
Look, the air conditioner

22:13.440 --> 22:14.240
and Wi-Fi

22:14.520 --> 22:15.920
have all been fixed by Sniper Master.

22:17.160 --> 22:17.880
Sniper Master?

22:18.360 --> 22:19.800
That's my cousin, Xing Wu.

22:21.600 --> 22:22.960
The guy you called

22:23.000 --> 22:23.760
a local tough guy?

22:24.480 --> 22:25.480
He's nothing like that.

22:43.040 --> 22:43.640
Qing Ye,

22:44.480 --> 22:45.080
are you really

22:45.080 --> 22:45.800
planning to stay here?

22:50.320 --> 22:51.720
I know where I stand now.

22:53.440 --> 22:54.680
I've got plans for the future.

22:55.920 --> 22:58.040
I'm going to spend a year here

22:58.880 --> 22:59.760
preparing for the college entrance exam.

23:00.720 --> 23:02.160
After that, I can go anywhere I want.

23:02.680 --> 23:03.880
What if I say

23:04.760 --> 23:06.120
I want to take you away right now?

23:06.560 --> 23:07.480
Would you come with me?

23:10.920 --> 23:11.720
Then tell me,

23:12.520 --> 23:14.040
how do you plan to take me away?

23:29.720 --> 23:30.880
Go home with me the day after tomorrow.

23:31.200 --> 23:33.120
We'll go abroad together a week later.

23:43.360 --> 23:44.720
When did you book the tickets?

23:45.080 --> 23:45.760
A few days ago.

23:46.400 --> 23:47.080
I was going to send you

23:47.080 --> 23:48.120
the e-tickets directly,

23:48.440 --> 23:48.960
but I thought

23:48.960 --> 23:50.120
printed copies feel more formal.

23:51.080 --> 23:52.160
Consider it a surprise.

24:13.600 --> 24:14.440
Financial proof,

24:14.600 --> 24:15.760
summer school admission letter,

24:15.800 --> 24:16.480
rental contract,

24:16.920 --> 24:17.800
visa documents,

24:18.640 --> 24:20.240
and all my savings.

24:22.800 --> 24:24.040
Everything's ready.

24:24.760 --> 24:25.600
Just waiting for you to say yes.

24:52.880 --> 24:53.400
What's wrong?

24:58.480 --> 24:59.720
I've already made up my mind.

25:00.640 --> 25:02.000
I'm settling down here

25:02.520 --> 25:03.400
to prepare for the exam.

25:05.040 --> 25:06.440
This sudden news

25:08.440 --> 25:09.200
has caught me off guard.

25:12.400 --> 25:14.080
My biggest regret was

25:15.040 --> 25:16.360
letting He Leling

25:16.360 --> 25:17.120
handle our visa.

25:17.240 --> 25:18.720
We could've left the country already.

25:20.120 --> 25:20.760
But it's okay.

25:21.640 --> 25:23.000
If we can't go to that country,

25:23.160 --> 25:24.320
we can pick another.

25:25.640 --> 25:26.440
You can go back

25:26.440 --> 25:27.400
to your old life.

25:28.560 --> 25:29.120
Even if you...

25:35.600 --> 25:36.440
What are you doing here?

25:39.240 --> 25:40.640
Li Lanfang sent me to take you home.

25:43.000 --> 25:43.760
Auntie?

25:47.160 --> 25:48.720
Hello, I'm Meng Ruihang.

25:50.680 --> 25:52.360
My hands are dirty from work.

25:55.560 --> 25:56.480
You must be Xing Wu.

25:56.840 --> 25:57.840
Qing Ye has told me about you.

25:58.600 --> 26:00.200
I haven't heard your name from her.

26:02.560 --> 26:03.000
It's fine.

26:03.320 --> 26:04.480
At least we know each other now.

26:05.120 --> 26:06.000
Thank you

26:06.040 --> 26:07.080
for looking after Qing Ye all this time.

26:07.520 --> 26:08.440
I'll take care of her from now on.

26:15.320 --> 26:16.000
Meng Ruihang.

26:16.640 --> 26:17.760
You've been running around all day.

26:17.760 --> 26:18.880
Go get some rest first.

26:19.160 --> 26:20.360
About what you said earlier,

26:21.480 --> 26:22.520
give me some time.

26:23.240 --> 26:24.120
I need to think it over.

26:29.880 --> 26:30.240
Alright. Let me know your answer

26:31.680 --> 26:32.840
before the day after tomorrow.

26:33.520 --> 26:34.080
I'll be waiting.

26:41.120 --> 26:41.600
Let's go.

26:45.800 --> 26:46.720
Bye, cousin.

26:58.720 --> 27:00.200
Why are you driving Shuhan's car?

27:01.960 --> 27:02.480
I borrowed it.

27:05.520 --> 27:06.920
Did work go well today?

27:09.200 --> 27:09.760
It was okay.

27:16.240 --> 27:17.000
Meng Ruihang

27:18.720 --> 27:19.640
wants to take you back to Beijing?

27:23.120 --> 27:24.320
He wants to take me abroad.

27:40.760 --> 27:41.400
What's wrong?

27:44.160 --> 27:44.680
Hungry.

27:45.400 --> 27:46.280
Gonna go get some food.

27:48.120 --> 27:48.720
Me too.

27:49.280 --> 27:49.920
Let's go together.

28:03.240 --> 28:03.640
Sir.

28:04.080 --> 28:04.360
Here.

28:04.400 --> 28:04.880
Your kettle.

28:04.920 --> 28:05.360
Okay.

28:05.480 --> 28:06.280
Thanks.

28:18.320 --> 28:19.600
This way of boiling water

28:19.600 --> 28:20.880
is really old-fashioned.

28:21.840 --> 28:22.680
I haven't seen anyone use firewood

28:22.680 --> 28:23.840
to boil water for ages.

28:24.960 --> 28:26.560
These kettles hold lots of water

28:26.640 --> 28:27.280
and heat up fast.

28:27.720 --> 28:29.200
One boil fills two thermoses.

28:30.160 --> 28:31.920
It also works as a heater in winter.

28:32.240 --> 28:33.280
People sit around it

28:33.400 --> 28:34.920
roasting sweet potatoes and chestnuts.

28:35.640 --> 28:37.000
City folks probably never seen this.

28:37.480 --> 28:38.600
Just like the popular

28:38.600 --> 28:39.360
stove-side tea gathering, right?

28:39.480 --> 28:39.960
Exactly.

28:40.000 --> 28:41.600
That's what it's called.

28:44.680 --> 28:46.360
Only a few hours by high-speed train,

28:47.360 --> 28:48.640
yet it feels like two different worlds.

28:54.640 --> 28:55.720
So are you ready

28:56.480 --> 28:57.640
to go back to your old life?

29:02.200 --> 29:03.080
People

29:03.920 --> 29:05.480
are strange sometimes.

29:07.480 --> 29:09.320
We always hope a great opportunity

29:10.000 --> 29:10.880
will fall from the sky.

29:11.960 --> 29:13.800
But when a real good chance

29:13.920 --> 29:15.120
shows up,

29:16.000 --> 29:17.480
we start hesitating.

29:19.840 --> 29:20.360
Xing Wu,

29:21.640 --> 29:22.760
what do you think

29:23.200 --> 29:23.720
I should do?

29:24.240 --> 29:25.160
Leave or stay?

29:26.160 --> 29:27.000
I wish you'd stay.

29:41.600 --> 29:42.200
What's this?

29:42.720 --> 29:44.320
You wanted to go to the amusement park.

29:49.600 --> 29:50.800
I hope you make the choice

29:51.520 --> 29:52.720
you truly believe is best.

29:57.360 --> 29:58.560
I'll think it over carefully.

30:02.760 --> 30:04.000
I won't push you.

30:04.880 --> 30:06.000
But I'm the one who brought you back.

30:06.600 --> 30:07.720
Whether you leave now,

30:07.720 --> 30:08.720
or a year from now,

30:09.240 --> 30:10.440
I'll take good care of you

30:11.200 --> 30:12.160
every day you stay.

30:15.720 --> 30:16.320
Got it.

30:18.320 --> 30:18.840
Let's eat.

30:32.440 --> 30:32.880
Hello?

30:35.440 --> 30:36.000
It's broken again?

30:37.400 --> 30:38.840
Got it, I'll be right over.

30:42.000 --> 30:42.600
Wu.

30:43.320 --> 30:43.800
Come take a look.

30:44.440 --> 30:45.280
It's broken again.

30:45.640 --> 30:46.440
What's wrong this time?

30:46.880 --> 30:48.280
I just fixed it a few days ago.

30:48.560 --> 30:50.120
It keeps cutting out on and off.

30:52.480 --> 30:53.320
Were you playing games again?

30:55.040 --> 30:55.800
Just a couple rounds.

30:56.120 --> 30:57.160
Your graphics card and CPU

30:57.160 --> 30:57.720
can't run monitoring software

30:57.760 --> 30:59.240
and games

30:59.240 --> 31:00.080
at the same time.

31:01.080 --> 31:01.840
Did you close the game?

31:02.160 --> 31:02.960
Yeah.

31:03.160 --> 31:03.680
Did you restart?

31:03.760 --> 31:04.720
I did, but it still doesn't work.

31:04.720 --> 31:05.640
Please take a look.

31:25.840 --> 31:26.880
I'm at the police station.

31:27.160 --> 31:28.160
Don't make me call the cops.

31:38.720 --> 31:39.360
Hello, Mom.

31:39.800 --> 31:40.640
You little brat.

31:40.680 --> 31:41.520
I was gonna call the police

31:41.520 --> 31:42.480
if you didn't pick up.

31:42.720 --> 31:43.320
Mom.

31:43.760 --> 31:45.200
You're overreacting.

31:45.440 --> 31:46.280
I'm totally fine.

31:46.480 --> 31:47.640
How old are you?

31:47.720 --> 31:49.120
Still running away from home?

31:49.240 --> 31:50.120
Come back right now.

31:50.360 --> 31:51.920
Didn't I tell you in our messages?

31:51.960 --> 31:53.360
I'm just traveling to clear my head.

31:54.000 --> 31:55.320
You've always been so reasonable.

31:55.320 --> 31:56.480
Surely you won't take away

31:56.480 --> 31:57.440
this little bit of freedom from me?

31:57.560 --> 31:58.520
Cut the crap.

31:58.720 --> 31:59.800
I know exactly what you're up to.

31:59.800 --> 32:00.840
You went to find Qing Ye.

32:01.440 --> 32:02.760
I can let other things slide,

32:03.280 --> 32:04.400
but not this.

32:04.880 --> 32:05.760
I've told you before,

32:06.080 --> 32:06.640
her family

32:06.640 --> 32:08.160
will drag us down too.

32:08.280 --> 32:10.120
You've said that hundreds of times.

32:10.720 --> 32:12.560
I understand where you're coming from.

32:12.720 --> 32:13.760
That's why I'm handling this

32:13.760 --> 32:14.800
on my own.

32:15.880 --> 32:16.720
Think you're all grown up now,

32:16.720 --> 32:17.520
too big for your own boots?

32:17.720 --> 32:18.920
No matter where you are,

32:19.320 --> 32:20.280
I want you back home

32:20.280 --> 32:20.920
by tomorrow night.

32:21.200 --> 32:21.840
I'll overlook what you've done

32:21.840 --> 32:23.120
these past two days.

32:23.480 --> 32:24.040
Otherwise...

32:24.120 --> 32:25.680
You'll freeze my bank cards,

32:25.840 --> 32:27.240
track my phone,

32:28.080 --> 32:29.440
and send Dad's people to fetch me?

32:30.240 --> 32:31.400
Since you know all that,

32:31.760 --> 32:33.240
don't make me resort to such measures

32:33.240 --> 32:33.880
against you.

32:35.360 --> 32:36.560
I have my own plans.

32:37.200 --> 32:38.560
Your threats won't work on me.

32:40.040 --> 32:42.000
Are you trying to drive me crazy?

32:42.880 --> 32:44.000
I just want to take Qing Ye away.

32:44.440 --> 32:44.840
You...

32:57.680 --> 32:58.480
Hey everyone!

32:58.560 --> 32:59.800
Thanks to my top gifter!

33:00.840 --> 33:01.880
I'll dance for you guys.

33:02.240 --> 33:03.480
Turn up the music!

33:06.760 --> 33:08.720
Thanks, little grass baby.

33:09.000 --> 33:10.240
Appreciate the gifts!

33:10.320 --> 33:11.040
Thank you!

33:11.120 --> 33:13.480
I want nobody nobody but you.

33:14.480 --> 33:16.520
I want nobody nobody but you.

33:16.640 --> 33:18.640
I want nobody nobody but you.

33:20.400 --> 33:20.880
Hey buddy,

33:21.120 --> 33:22.480
could you please keep it down?

33:23.120 --> 33:23.800
What did you say?

33:24.120 --> 33:26.320
Could you please keep it down?

33:27.800 --> 33:29.640
I'm live streaming. I'm a streamer.

33:29.720 --> 33:30.560
If I keep quiet,

33:30.600 --> 33:31.800
how am I supposed to get gifts?

33:31.960 --> 33:32.560
Besides,

33:32.600 --> 33:33.480
what's it to you?

33:33.720 --> 33:34.400
I'm gonna stay loud!

33:34.560 --> 33:36.520
Nobody nobody but you.

33:36.840 --> 33:37.440
But you.

33:37.640 --> 33:39.480
Nobody nobody but you.

33:42.120 --> 33:42.680
Stop right there.

33:43.840 --> 33:44.600
That's it?

33:44.800 --> 33:46.120
I was live streaming.

33:46.160 --> 33:47.120
You just ruined my stream!

33:47.160 --> 33:48.520
Viewers were sending me big gifts!

33:48.560 --> 33:49.320
You come here with that sour face

33:49.320 --> 33:50.320
looking for trouble?

33:50.400 --> 33:51.560
Your girlfriend ran off with someone, huh?

33:56.240 --> 33:57.080
You wanna fight for real?

33:57.080 --> 33:58.360
Four-eyes!

33:58.480 --> 33:58.960
You...

34:02.560 --> 34:03.160
No, Xing Wu.

34:03.240 --> 34:04.040
Call the police.

34:04.720 --> 34:06.000
Stop fighting!

34:06.280 --> 34:07.000
Please, stop!

34:07.600 --> 34:08.360
Please, stop!

34:09.400 --> 34:10.040
Stop it.

34:11.360 --> 34:11.920
I give up!

34:11.920 --> 34:12.400
Officer Xu.

34:12.440 --> 34:13.080
I give up!

34:18.199 --> 34:18.719
Officer Xu,

34:19.000 --> 34:20.320
look what he did to me!

34:20.560 --> 34:21.800
I'm a live streamer known for my looks.

34:21.880 --> 34:23.120
My face is how I make a living.

34:23.159 --> 34:23.719
- Enough.
- Look...

34:24.239 --> 34:24.800
I see it.

34:24.960 --> 34:25.480
Take a seat first.

34:27.360 --> 34:27.840
You,

34:28.400 --> 34:29.000
tell me your side.

34:31.600 --> 34:32.639
Yeah, I hit him.

34:33.960 --> 34:35.239
Look how arrogant he is!

34:35.639 --> 34:36.679
He was clearly

34:36.679 --> 34:37.360
picking a fight on purpose.

34:37.440 --> 34:38.159
Arrest him!

34:38.639 --> 34:40.199
But he threw the first punch.

34:40.480 --> 34:41.719
I was just defending myself.

34:41.920 --> 34:43.080
That's nonsense.

34:43.600 --> 34:44.760
Who's your witness?

34:46.719 --> 34:47.120
Him.

34:49.360 --> 34:49.880
Wu.

34:50.840 --> 34:51.920
Anything to say?

34:55.159 --> 34:56.120
I was just passing by.

34:56.560 --> 34:58.320
Didn't see who started it.

34:59.040 --> 35:00.600
Nice one, buddy.

35:00.960 --> 35:02.320
But I saw

35:03.840 --> 35:04.520
he stepped on the glasses.

35:05.360 --> 35:05.800
That's right.

35:06.440 --> 35:09.240
Those glasses cost over 8000 yuan.

35:09.600 --> 35:09.960
8000...

35:10.000 --> 35:11.600
I didn't! That's way too expensive.

35:11.840 --> 35:12.360
Enough.

35:12.800 --> 35:14.120
Whoever broke the glasses pays.

35:14.360 --> 35:15.360
Since neither of you can tell

35:15.360 --> 35:16.120
who threw the first punch,

35:16.440 --> 35:17.320
come with me to the station.

35:17.840 --> 35:18.320
Take them away.

35:18.520 --> 35:19.320
I just remembered,

35:19.600 --> 35:20.720
I fixed the hallway surveillance

35:20.720 --> 35:21.560
last month.

35:21.760 --> 35:22.200
Hao.

35:22.520 --> 35:23.160
Pull up the footage

35:23.160 --> 35:24.280
for Officer Xu.

35:25.760 --> 35:26.800
No need, really!

35:27.120 --> 35:28.360
Forget about the glasses.

35:28.560 --> 35:29.200
No compensation needed.

35:30.320 --> 35:31.000
Yeah, Officer Xu.

35:31.040 --> 35:32.600
We're actually buddies.

35:32.760 --> 35:33.760
He's my buddy.

35:34.600 --> 35:35.200
Just messing around.

35:35.240 --> 35:36.080
That's right.

35:36.080 --> 35:37.120
We're all brothers out here.

35:37.360 --> 35:38.040
Right, right.

35:38.080 --> 35:38.520
Fine.

35:38.800 --> 35:39.640
So it's settled.

35:39.760 --> 35:41.360
Neither of you will press charges.

35:41.880 --> 35:43.280
Sign the reconciliation form.

35:43.400 --> 35:44.640
No problem at all.

35:49.040 --> 35:49.560
Officer Xu,

35:50.040 --> 35:50.720
thank you so much.

35:50.800 --> 35:51.440
Sorry for the trouble.

35:51.920 --> 35:52.480
Take care.

35:53.840 --> 35:54.760
Thanks, Officer Xu.

35:55.360 --> 35:55.880
Thanks.

35:59.080 --> 36:00.680
He got off lucky

36:00.720 --> 36:01.640
not being locked up.

36:04.120 --> 36:05.040
You threw the first punch.

36:05.400 --> 36:05.960
You wouldn't have gotten away

36:05.960 --> 36:07.000
scot-free at the station.

36:09.600 --> 36:10.320
So what?

36:10.720 --> 36:11.760
You want me to thank you or something?

36:14.960 --> 36:15.680
Didn't know

36:16.240 --> 36:17.240
you could fight well.

36:18.360 --> 36:18.840
I've got skills.

36:19.960 --> 36:21.840
I've practiced Taekwondo

36:21.880 --> 36:22.680
since second grade.

36:23.200 --> 36:23.760
Black belt.

36:24.000 --> 36:24.640
No joke.

36:26.760 --> 36:27.720
So you're not badly hurt.

36:29.720 --> 36:30.560
Just minor scratches.

36:31.080 --> 36:32.000
But my phone is broken.

36:32.240 --> 36:33.200
I've got no cash now.

36:34.640 --> 36:35.640
Qing Ye said you know how to fix things.

36:35.800 --> 36:36.360
Help me out.

36:38.360 --> 36:39.000
Need to replace the screen.

36:39.320 --> 36:40.400
Won't be fixed anytime soon.

36:44.840 --> 36:46.280
Nowhere to stay tonight.

36:50.280 --> 36:51.080
You know what?

36:51.600 --> 36:52.800
Maybe I should go beat him up again

36:53.320 --> 36:54.800
and spend the night

36:54.800 --> 36:55.360
at the police station.

36:57.520 --> 36:59.080
Been too well-behaved all your life,

36:59.240 --> 37:00.600
now you're letting loose here?

37:03.000 --> 37:04.480
Ever heard of environmental determinism?

37:04.920 --> 37:06.000
One's behavior

37:07.080 --> 37:08.400
is shaped by outside influences.

37:10.680 --> 37:11.480
Are you saying

37:11.480 --> 37:13.200
this remote place

37:13.960 --> 37:15.080
turned you into a troublemaker?

37:15.120 --> 37:16.360
It's primal nature.

37:17.600 --> 37:18.360
Here, people

37:19.120 --> 37:20.200
don't hold back their true selves.

37:21.560 --> 37:22.840
Anyway, thanks for today.

37:25.400 --> 37:26.240
Don't mention it.

37:26.720 --> 37:27.600
I wasn't helping you on purpose.

37:30.160 --> 37:31.720
I need to ask you something.

37:34.120 --> 37:34.600
Go ahead.

37:38.120 --> 37:39.240
You're taking Qing Ye abroad?

37:40.680 --> 37:41.160
Yes.

37:56.240 --> 37:57.280
If you'd like,

37:58.320 --> 37:59.240
you can come stay at Zhazhating.

38:00.640 --> 38:01.600
My home is yours too.

38:03.720 --> 38:04.280
I promise

38:05.000 --> 38:05.920
your clothes

38:06.400 --> 38:07.200
won't go missing again.

38:16.880 --> 38:18.040
Nice new haircut.

38:21.880 --> 38:22.720
Looks like

38:22.720 --> 38:23.720
that anime character,

38:23.720 --> 38:24.840
the red-haired princess.

38:26.240 --> 38:26.880
Merida?

38:27.120 --> 38:27.520
Yeah.

38:30.080 --> 38:31.120
But my hair is black.

38:34.200 --> 38:35.560
Black hair looks better than red.

38:38.080 --> 38:38.880
Definitely.

39:28.080 --> 39:28.800
Mom.

39:29.840 --> 39:31.400
Which one should I choose?

39:38.840 --> 39:39.520
Wanna know?

39:41.240 --> 39:42.640
Do I get a place

39:43.240 --> 39:43.880
to stay tonight?

39:44.160 --> 39:45.120
You're bargaining with me?

39:45.560 --> 39:46.560
Where do you get the confidence?

39:47.600 --> 39:49.920
Ye says you have a cold face but a warm heart.

39:50.160 --> 39:51.040
You wouldn't leave me stranded.

39:51.240 --> 39:51.800
I trust her.

40:00.920 --> 40:01.600
You're really leaving?

40:13.920 --> 40:15.080
This is what we've got here.

40:15.600 --> 40:16.280
Take it or leave it.

40:16.800 --> 40:18.440
Got a Plan B?

40:19.040 --> 40:19.800
Sofa outside.

40:22.040 --> 40:22.640
What about Plan C?

40:24.720 --> 40:25.600
Head out of Xuan Island.

40:25.920 --> 40:27.000
Sleep wherever you like.

40:28.720 --> 40:29.160
Got it.

40:39.640 --> 40:40.560
People would think

40:40.600 --> 40:41.440
you're living

40:41.440 --> 40:42.320
back in the 90s.

40:42.640 --> 40:43.720
Such retro decor.

40:47.120 --> 40:47.960
And this wooden bed.

40:48.040 --> 40:49.120
Doesn't it hurt to sleep on?

40:51.560 --> 40:52.560
Are you really sure

40:53.800 --> 40:54.800
about taking Qing Ye abroad?

40:56.800 --> 40:57.920
I've planned everything carefully.

40:58.240 --> 40:59.240
I have enough savings

40:59.240 --> 41:00.640
for us to live overseas

41:00.640 --> 41:02.040
without working for two years.

41:02.520 --> 41:04.240
Our IELTS scores

41:04.280 --> 41:05.640
and award certificates

41:05.760 --> 41:07.400
will help us win scholarships.

41:08.240 --> 41:09.720
We can take part-time jobs

41:09.840 --> 41:11.400
and work on domestic startup projects

41:12.000 --> 41:12.760
to support ourselves

41:12.800 --> 41:13.800
through college abroad.

41:16.480 --> 41:17.360
Do your parents approve?

41:19.400 --> 41:20.400
I saw her

41:20.520 --> 41:21.760
leaving your place in tears.

41:24.280 --> 41:25.440
We're adults.

41:26.560 --> 41:27.680
We don't have to ask our parents

41:27.720 --> 41:29.080
for every decision.

41:29.680 --> 41:30.920
I'm sure you also have things

41:30.920 --> 41:32.000
you'd stick to

41:32.440 --> 41:33.320
even if everyone disagrees.

41:34.960 --> 41:35.960
Taking Qing Ye abroad

41:36.000 --> 41:37.120
is exactly that for me.

41:48.280 --> 41:49.320
Why are you doing all this for her?

41:54.280 --> 41:55.280
Because I love her.

42:03.120 --> 42:04.560
Our families have been close for generations.

42:05.080 --> 42:06.160
We grew up together.

42:06.160 --> 42:07.440
We went to the same international school.

42:07.920 --> 42:09.440
We were never apart, except

42:09.800 --> 42:11.080
during her leave of absence.

42:12.720 --> 42:13.760
I've loved her since we were kids.

42:16.920 --> 42:17.720
She took a break from school?

42:18.640 --> 42:20.160
Her mom fell seriously ill in tenth grade.

42:21.080 --> 42:22.280
She took a year off

42:22.400 --> 42:23.160
to stay with her mom

42:23.160 --> 42:23.840
through her final days.

42:25.080 --> 42:25.840
She came back afterwards

42:25.840 --> 42:26.520
and started eleventh grade.

42:27.560 --> 42:28.160
But then,

42:28.520 --> 42:29.720
something happened to her dad.

42:32.960 --> 42:33.880
I'm curious though,

42:33.880 --> 42:35.160
why do you care so much about her?

42:35.160 --> 42:36.000
What makes you

42:38.560 --> 42:39.640
treat her so well?

42:42.480 --> 42:43.200
She's my cousin.

42:43.360 --> 42:43.880
I know you two

42:43.880 --> 42:44.720
share no blood ties.

42:44.760 --> 42:45.480
Does it matter?

42:45.480 --> 42:46.160
Of course it does.

42:49.720 --> 42:51.080
No one devotes themselves

42:51.080 --> 42:51.800
to someone selflessly

42:51.800 --> 42:52.880
for no reason.

42:53.920 --> 42:55.000
There's always a motive

42:55.000 --> 42:56.000
behind being kind.

43:05.760 --> 43:07.000
I'm just doing this for pay.

43:20.880 --> 43:21.280
All done.

43:22.240 --> 43:22.800
150 yuan.

43:24.240 --> 43:25.080
Nice work.

43:26.760 --> 43:27.320
Scan the code.

43:34.800 --> 43:35.560
Are you out of your mind?

43:35.920 --> 43:36.680
I gave you that money

43:36.680 --> 43:37.760
to do me a favor.

43:38.200 --> 43:39.080
Convince Qing Ye to go abroad.
